Date: Sat, 12 Sep 2026 19:30:50 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 13/52] arm64: dts: qcom: sm7325-nothing-spacewar: enlace hostless
 CS-Voice para las llamadas

Los servicios MVM/CVS/CVP de voz ya los declara kodiak.dtsi en 7.2.9, asi que
aqui solo queda lo que falta: el front-end sin codec («CS-Voice») que, al abrirse,
levanta la sesion de voz del DSP que une el vocoder del modem con los puertos AFE.
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm7325-nothing-spacewar.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm7325-nothing-spacewar.dts
@@ -12,6 +12,7 @@
 #include <dt-bindings/leds/common.h>
 #include <dt-bindings/media/video-interfaces.h>
 #include <dt-bindings/pinctrl/qcom,pmic-gpio.h>
+#include <dt-bindings/sound/qcom,q6voice.h>
 #include <dt-bindings/regulator/qcom,rpmh-regulator.h>
 #include <dt-bindings/sound/qcom,q6afe.h>
 #include <dt-bindings/sound/qcom,q6asm.h>
@@ -1402,6 +1403,20 @@
 			sound-dai = <&tfa9873_l 0>, <&tfa9873_r 0>;
 		};
 	};
+
+	/*
+	 * Hostless front-end for CS voice calls: opening this PCM brings up the
+	 * q6voice DSP session (MVM/CVS/CVP) that bridges the modem vocoder to the
+	 * AFE ports. No samples cross the CPU, so there is no codec here.
+	 */
+	cs-voice-dai-link {
+		link-name = "CS-Voice";
+
+		cpu {
+			sound-dai = <&q6voicedai CS_VOICE>;
+		};
+	};
+
 };
 
 &spi13 {
